question:
Find the numbers of ordered array $(x_1,...,x_{100})$ that satisfies the following conditions:
($i$)$x_1,...,x_{100}\in\{1,2,..,2017\}$;
($ii$)$2017|x_1+...+x_{100}$;
($iii$)$2017|x_1^2+...+x_{100}^2$.

Find the number of ordered quadruples $(a,b,c,d)$ of nonnegative real numbers such that
\begin{align*}
a^2 + b^2 + c^2 + d^2 &= 4, \\
(a + b + c + d)(a^3 + b^3 + c^3 + d^3) &= 16.
\end{align*}
